    {
      "en": {
        "short": "Cache",
        "title": "A cache returns a stored answer",
        "body": [
          "When the same question arrives again and again, a cache such as Redis returns a stored answer.",
          "A semantic cache also matches similar questions."
        ]
      },
      "bn": {
